{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "module": "Node16",
    "moduleResolution": "Node16",
    "target": "ES2022",
    "lib": ["ES2022"],
    "outDir": "out-test",
    "rootDir": "src",
    "sourceMap": false,
    "strict": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true,
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "comment": "Compila solo la lógica pura (grafo + scanner + tests). Los módulos que dependen de 'vscode' (extension.ts, ui/, vscodeFileSystem.ts) se excluyen: los tests corren en Node puro sin el host de VS Code.",
  "include": [
    "src/graph/**/*.ts",
    "src/scanner/graphBuilder.ts",
    "src/scanner/importParser.ts",
    "src/test/**/*.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "dist", "out-test"]
}
